{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00862","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高二首 一 · 沈佺期","name":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山峰十二，环合隐昭回。\n俯眺琵琶峡，平看云雨台。\n古槎天外倚，瀑水日边来。\n何忽啼猨夜，荆王枕席开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}